{
  "id": 9007282356460,
  "title": "RUIPRO MPO Female to Female Full Fiber Optic Armored Cable, 7-Core Type A, OM3 Multimode, Compatible with Detachable HDMI 2.1 GEN4AK System",
  "handle": "ruipro-mpo-female-to-female-fiber-optic-cable-7-core-type-a-om3-multimode",
  "description": "<p><b><span><strong>Model Number: MK37FFAB</strong></span></b></p>\n<p>The RUIPRO MPO fiber optic cable is designed for use with the RUIPRO Detachable Full Fiber Optic HDMI 2.1 GEN4AK system. Built with 7-core Type A OM3 multimode fibers, it ensures high-speed, stable, and lossless data transmission over long distances.</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><b>Key Features:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\">MPO Female to Female Fiber Optic Cable, 7-core Type A OM3 cable.</li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\">A polarity, PC polish, 50/125\u00b5m multimode fiber.</li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\">Stainless steel armored structure of the cable ensures bend flexibility, tensile strength, compression resistance, and tangle-free performance.</li>\n<li>Limit bending radius: D30mm, 10 circles can work<br>\n</li>\n</ul>",
  "published_at": "2025-09-05T17:00:45+08:00",
